WEBVTT

00:10:56.777 --> 00:11:00.155
We could make sure that every migrant

00:11:00.155 --> 00:11:04.410
has a fair chance of putting
their best legal case forward.

00:11:05.494 --> 00:11:11.041
Because immigration prisons
don't get us out of a problem.

00:11:11.917 --> 00:11:14.920
Immigration prisons are the problem.

00:11:15.295 --> 00:11:22.302
(Cheers and applause)

00:11:22.511 --> 00:11:28.642
They blind us to the past,
when we did things differently,

00:11:28.684 --> 00:11:33.021
and they distract us
from the moneymaking tentacles